{"id":"wb-6-926","name":"马勒住宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"马勒别墅","text":"马勒别墅（英语：Moller Villa），位于上海市陕西南路30号，是由英籍瑞典人埃里克·马勒于1927年在原开平大班住宅的基础上扩建的具有北欧风格的花园别墅。其独特的设计包括棕色瓷砖的哥特式和都铎式山墙、尖顶和尖塔。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A9%AC%E5%8B%92%E5%88%AB%E5%A2%85","revisionId":94585056,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94585056","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3d86e6579e77f871f22424ed.jpg","title":"Moller_Villa,_Shanghai.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Moller_Villa,_Shanghai.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Moller_Villa%2C_Shanghai.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Legolas1024","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​上海马勒别墅","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"马勒别墅"}}